@WebApp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5047
@Book_Id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 1. Get All Books

GET {{WebApp_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Book

GET {{WebApp_HostAddress}}/api/books/{{Book_Id}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Insert Book

POST {{WebApp_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Id": "{{Book_Id}}", "Author": "Tester", "Title": "Tested" }

### 4. Update Book

PUT {{WebApp_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Id": "{{Book_Id}}", "Author": "Editor", "Title": "Edited" }

### 5. Remove Book

DELETE {{WebApp_HostAddress}}/api/books/{{Book_Id}}
Accept: application/json

###
